  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Policy and Outreach Partnership in Argentina and Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The overall objective of the project is to support the fulfilment of the European Union (EU) foreign policy objectives by strengthening its ability to engage meaningfully with target audiences and stakeholders in Argentina and Brazil through various public diplomacy channels.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
